.TH OPJ_JPIP3D_SERVER 1 "2026-02-21" "OpenJP3D 0.1.0" "OpenJP3D Manual"
.SH NAME
opj_jpip3d_server \- standalone JPIP server for JP3D datasets
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opj_jpip3d_server
.RB [ \-h ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB [ \-v ]
.RB \-d\ \fIname\fR
.RB \-f\ \fIfile.jp3d\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B opj_jpip3d_server
loads a JP3D codestream and serves it via the JPIP 3\-D protocol.
Requests are read from standard input (one URL query string per line)
and responses are written to standard output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d\ \fIname\fR
Dataset name (required).
.TP
.BR \-f\ \fIfile\fR
JP3D codestream file to serve (required).
.TP
.BR \-v
Verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-h ,\ \-\-help
Print help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
echo 'dataset=vol&fsiz3d=256,256,128&roff3d=0,0,0&rsiz3d=64,64,32' \\
  | opj_jpip3d_server \-d vol \-f volume.jp3d
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR opj_jp3d_compress (1),
.BR opj_jp3d_decompress (1)
